                <head>Appendix to CF–14</head>
                <p rendition="#center">[<hi rendition="#italic">Draft Reply to Herr
                        Brockdorff-Rantzau Regarding Prisoners of War</hi>]</p>
                <p>[This draft was approved by the Council at the meeting of May 20, 11 a.m.
                    (CF–20), and the reply, dated Paris, May 20, 1919, signed by G. Clemenceau, is
                    printed as appendix IV to CF–20, <ref target="#pg749">page 749</ref>.]</p>
